      "publishedAt": "Mon Aug 12 2024 02:06:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "question": "<p>What is the penalty for contracting without a license in California?</p>",
      "answer": "<p>Fines up to $5,000 and/or up to six months in jail.</p>",
