      "publishedAt": "Mon Aug 12 2024 02:06:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "question": "<p>Describe \"Surety Bond.\"</p>",
      "answer": "<p>A financial guarantee that the contractor will fulfill contractual obligations.</p>",
