      "publishedAt": "Mon Aug 12 2024 02:06:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "question": "<p>Explain \"Right to Cancel\" in home improvement contracts.</p>",
      "answer": "<p>Homeowners have three business days to cancel a contract without penalty.</p>",
      "type": "Law and Business"
