      "updatedAt": "Sun Aug 11 2024 19:11:09 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "publishedAt": "Mon Aug 12 2024 02:06:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "question": "<p>What is \"Workers' Compensation Exemption\"?</p>",
      "answer": "<p>An exemption filed by a sole proprietor or partnership without employees, stating they are not required to carry workers' compensation insurance.</p>",
      "type": "Law and Business"
    },
    {
      "id": "66b90cce706977e899254a58",
