      "publishedAt": "Mon Aug 12 2024 02:06:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "question": "<p>Define \"Notice to Owner.\"</p>",
      "answer": "<p>A document informing property owners of their legal rights and responsibilities under the Mechanics Lien Law.</p>",
      "type": "Law and Business"
    },
    {
