      "publishedAt": "Mon Aug 12 2024 02:06:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "question": "<p>What is a \"Preliminary Notice\"?</p>",
      "answer": "<p>A notice that must be given by subcontractors and material suppliers to inform the property owner of their right to file a mechanics lien.</p>",
      "type": "Law and Business"
    },
    {
