      "updatedAt": "Sun Aug 11 2024 19:11:10 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "publishedAt": "Mon Aug 12 2024 02:06:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "question": "<p>What is a \"Contractor's Bond\"?</p>",
      "answer": "<p>A bond required for licensure to ensure compliance with state laws and protect consumers against contractor fraud or negligence.</p>",
      "type": "Law and Business"
    },
    {
