      "updatedAt": "Sun Aug 11 2024 19:11:10 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "publishedAt": "Mon Aug 12 2024 02:06:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "question": "<p>Define \"Indirect Costs.\"</p>",
      "answer": "<p>Costs that are not directly attributable to a specific project but necessary for overall business operations, such as office rent and utilities.</p>",
      "type": "Law and Business"
    },
    {
      "id": "66b90cce81ce1bdd2531b33e",
      "slug": "61",
      "name": "61",
      "archived": false,
      "draft": false,
      "createdAt": "Sun Aug 11 2024 19:11:10 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "updatedAt": "Sun Aug 11 2024 19:11:10 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "publishedAt": "Mon Aug 12 2024 02:06:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "question": "<p>What is \"Overhead\"?</p>",
      "answer": "<p>Ongoing business expenses not directly tied to a specific project, such as administrative salaries, marketing, and office supplies.</p>",
      "type": "Law and Business"
    },
    {
      "id": "66b90ccf7bb06b7704fc8b4f",
      "slug": "62",
      "name": "62",
      "archived": false,
      "draft": false,
      "createdAt": "Sun Aug 11 2024 19:11:11 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "updatedAt": "Sun Aug 11 2024 19:11:11 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "publishedAt": "Mon Aug 12 2024 02:06:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "question": "<p>Describe \"Gross Profit.\"</p>",
      "answer": "<p>The difference between total revenue and the direct costs of completing a project.</p>",
      "type": "Law and Business"
    },
    {
      "id": "66b90cceae3d181a226f3a90",
      "slug": "63",
