      "publishedAt": "Mon Aug 12 2024 02:06:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "question": "<p>Define \"Cash Flow.\"</p>",
      "answer": "<p>The movement of money into and out of a business, crucial for maintaining solvency and meeting financial obligations.</p>",
      "type": "Law and Business"
    },
    {
