      "publishedAt": "Mon Aug 12 2024 02:06:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "question": "<p>What is \"Cal/OSHA\"?</p>",
      "answer": "<p>The California Division of Occupational Safety and Health, responsible for ensuring safe working conditions in California.</p>",
      "type": "Law and Business"
