      "updatedAt": "Sun Aug 11 2024 19:11:11 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "publishedAt": "Mon Aug 12 2024 02:06:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "question": "<p>Describe the \"Family and Medical Leave Act\" (FMLA).</p>",
      "answer": "<p>A federal law allowing employees to take up to 12 weeks of unpaid leave for certain family and medical reasons.</p>",
      "type": "Law and Business"
