      "publishedAt": "Mon Aug 12 2024 02:06:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "question": "<p>What is \"Form W-2\"?</p>",
      "answer": "<p>A tax form used in the United States to report wages paid to employees and the taxes withheld from them.</p>",
      "type": "Law and Business"
