      "publishedAt": "Mon Aug 12 2024 02:06:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "question": "<p>What is the \"Equal Employment Opportunity Commission\" (EEOC)?</p>",
      "answer": "<p>A federal agency that enforces laws against workplace discrimination.</p>",
      "type": "Law and Business"
