      "publishedAt": "Mon Aug 12 2024 02:06:44 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)",
      "question": "<p>Define \"Americans with Disabilities Act\" (ADA).</p>",
      "answer": "<p>A federal law prohibiting discrimination against individuals with disabilities in all areas of public life, including jobs.</p>",
      "type": "Law and Business"
